  (text "GHI CHU:\n- Shield cam len header Arduino cua NUCLEO-F411RE. Nucleo cap nguon qua USB (ST-Link).\n  Muon chay doc lap: noi J2 (E5V_OUT) toi CN7 chan 6 (E5V), dat JP5 o vi tri 2-3 (UM1724).\n- PUL/DIR/ENA: driver dat jumper 5V; MOSFET keo PUL-/DIR-/ENA- xuong GND. Logic khong dao.\n- Gia tri buck theo datasheet TI LM2596 (SNVS124): Cin 470uF/50V, Cout 220uF/25V, L 68uH, diode 40V Schottky.\n- TF03: UART LVTTL 3.3V, nguon 5-24V, ~150 mA o 5V (datasheet TF03-180 V1.2)."
    (at 279.4 236.22 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left))
    (uuid 0456311a-b890-4a87-b662-5c0ffbaf5586)
  )

